{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game about grief and the invisible choices we live with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a home, shaped by loss. It doesn't follow the normal rules. Some rooms resemble moments that happened, while others are formed by memories that never had the chance to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement follows the emotional logic of mourning. It is uncertain, nonlinear, and difficult to face.\u00a0Avoiding what\u2019s painful can lead you in circles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some spaces respond when you look at them. Others remain hidden until you're ready.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting emotional architecture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms\u00a0shift around memory, emotion, and the way you choose to see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perception is progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While some doors are locked by keys, most are locked by emotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nonlinear journey through grief</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world shaped by sorrow, memory, and possibility. Each space is a reflection of something that did, or still does, matter.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What remains is not always what was.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845460?t=1751914981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845460?t=1751914981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845460/7ca74958376bfcfb40376e79ee8c2462aa0d9b8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751914981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845460/7ca74958376bfcfb40376e79ee8c2462aa0d9b8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751914981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game about grief and the invisible choices we live with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a home, shaped by loss. It doesn't follow the normal rules. Some rooms resemble moments that happened, while others are formed by memories that never had the chance to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement follows the emotional logic of mourning. It is uncertain, nonlinear, and difficult to face.\u00a0Avoiding what\u2019s painful can lead you in circles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some spaces respond when you look at them. Others remain hidden until you're ready.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting emotional architecture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms\u00a0shift around memory, emotion, and the way you choose to see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perception is progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While some doors are locked by keys, most are locked by emotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nonlinear journey through grief</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world shaped by sorrow, memory, and possibility. Each space is a reflection of something that did, or still does, matter.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What remains is not always what was.</h2>","developers":["Motus Ludos"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845460/896981140016d27ccf5a5da4d6e927397c43bf78/header.jpg?t=1751914981","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845460/1042241632/b7486944cbbb74c9622a134f65de1f3fba31c306/1751425917/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751914